ind":"update","title":"Demo Update | Thunder, Beiming Sea-Swallower and Menu Changes","summary":"October 25, 2026 This update adjusts Thunder and Beiming Sea-Swallower, fixes Kindling's battle-start resolution, and simplifies the main menu and effect descriptions. Combat Changes Thunder: The first detonation now deals base True Damage equal to 5% of the target's maximum HP. Each later detonation adds 1% of maximum HP. Each side counts separately; normal and Domain detonations share the count. Resets each battle. Tribulation Thunder Sword: While one remains active on your board, your Thunder","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T15:53:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042177","verified_at":"2026-10-25T20:15:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4641260-1846018067930094","game_id":"steam-4641260","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes | October 8, 2026","summary":"Updated three enchantments. Rushing Thunder has a 35% chance after each normal primary cast to perform another primary cast after 0.3 seconds; this can chain. Lofty increases all six base stats by 50% and grants immunity to Slow and Freeze. Bearing Earth destroys adjacent allied artifacts at battle start and inherits their opening base Damage, Shield, Healing, Regeneration, Burn and Wither. This triggers destruction and repair interactions. Repair does not grant the stats twice, and special cast","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T15:11:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930094","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4641260-1844751498230204","game_id":"steam-4641260","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update — September 28, 2026","summary":"Shops and Builds- Added 10 card pack shops, with 5 for each sect. Each shop offers 4 item slots, appears according to your sect and selected card packs, and has its own artwork.- Early card pack shops also stock selected basic Mortal artifacts. From round 7 onward, they sell only artifacts from their own pack. Card pack shops remain more common through rounds 5–8, giving you more time to complete your build.- Adjusted how regular shops appear over a run. Basic cultivation manual shops for your s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T00:54:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498230204","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4641260-1844751498217053","game_id":"steam-4641260","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update | September 23, 2026","summary":"Automatic Merging and Ascension Gifts - In Path to Ascension, acquiring an artifact or material with the same name and grade as one you own now merges them automatically. Merging can continue if another matching item is available at the new grade. The result keeps an owned item's position, including its equipment slot.- Each artifact grade-up grants one random material a grade below the artifact's new grade: Mortal to Spirit grants Mortal, Spirit to Immortal grants Spirit, and Immortal to Divine","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T01:12:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217053","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4641260-1844115010498189","game_id":"steam-4641260","kind":"update","title":"All-Night Ascension Demo Update — September 20, 2026","summary":"True Intent Rework- Reworked all 64 True Intents. Their effects apply throughout your current run as soon as you acquire them. They require no equipment slots, take up no space on your formation board or in your backpack, and use no Divine Sense. Each True Intent can only be acquired once per run.- True Intent rewards from minor realm advancements now show the effects of up to three options. Each reward offers one free reroll. If no eligible options remain, you receive 8 Spirit Stones instead.- ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T01:16:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010498189","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4641260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:28Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:28Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4641260":"2026-10-26T03:17:28Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4641260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5175640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4641260","app_id":4641260,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:45Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"a6362977e08a3e60cbd4ccc3f9c81bb72e35a509eba3a922c3e1d87c5f671857","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"영역 전개. 법칙이 바뀐다. 자신의 영역으로 상대를 제압할 것인가, 적의 영역과 충돌해 함께 무너질 것인가. 전투는 자동으로 진행되지만 영역은 당신이 통제한다. 먼저 펼쳐 제압하거나, 때를 기다려 반격하라.\r\n\r\n탐색에서 공법, 법기, 재료를 모은다. 3층 팔괘 진판에서 진형을 바꾸고 상대의 수를 깨뜨려 자동 전투를 가동한다. 양쪽 영역의 충전을 살피고, 기회를 노려 한순간에 영역을 펼쳐 승부를 결정하라.\r\n\r\n이번에는 이길 수 있을까?","publi